{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02940","headline":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制 · 崔日用","name":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘时迎气正璿衡，灞滻烟氛向晚清。\n剪绮裁红妙春色，宫梅殿柳识天情。\n瑶筐彩燕先呈端，金缕晨鸡未学鸣。\n圣泽阳和宜宴乐，年年捧日向东城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}